      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استهنأهُ</span></b>  <i>He asked him for aid, succour,</i>
or <i>defence.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He asked him for a
gift.</i> (K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>He conceded to him,</i> or
<i>gave him, a part of his dues,</i> or <i>rights.</i> (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  See 1.

